        }
      ],
      "title": "晨星之海·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33035001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "极镜水域，蔚蓝之海——\n生灵万物，纷至沓来——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "晨星陨落，不见朝阳——\n深渊回响，无尽阴霾——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "好熟悉的......歌声？唔——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "你醒了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "唔......我睡了多久？\n哈欠——身为幽灵，偶尔长眠也不错......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "你该走了，这不是属于你的归宿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "石膏的躯体无法承受温暖的阳光，只有黑暗与寒冷能够保护你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "嗯？贝歌，你讲的鬼故事还是这么无聊。\n来，我给你讲一个有意思的——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "嘘——！你还没有真正满足，还有想要追求的东西吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "那些雕塑所刻画的怪物，才是你深入骨髓的渴望，是你内心真正的写照。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "你的内心向往着它们，你的灵魂已经与它们融为一体。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "制造更多吧，直到填补内心的空缺为止。去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "今天的你......真的有点奇怪......\n去......哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "跟随你的心意，回到禁锢你的牢笼，那才是你最终的容身之地。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "......雕塑室？\n我......什么时候走到了这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咯吱、咯吱——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "雕塑，转过来了？！\n我没设计过这样的机关，这不可能！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪雕塑",
          "text": "深渊在凝视着你，海底在召唤着你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪雕塑",
          "text": "你是亡灵，是游荡在生死之间的异质。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "和江雕塑",
          "text": "嘻嘻嘻嘻——\n我们不会放过你的，我们会将你变成真正的幽灵——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33035021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "别......别！\n别过来，别过来！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33036001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "别过来，别......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33036002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "哈、哈——\n刚才的，是梦？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-765",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "qiluo",
          "rowIds": [
            33035001,
